## Legacy bridge (protocol knowledge and behavioral reference)

The console protocol knowledge, addressing tables, activation/deactivation
sequences and parameter layout are derived from the legacy
[CinemixAutomationBridge](https://github.com/ZioGuido/CinemixAutomationBridge)
by Guido Scognamiglio (GSi — Genuine Soundware and Instruments),
programmed July 2012, last updated February 2017. The legacy source headers
carry an MIT-style permission notice; its README additionally describes the
original release as freeware. The unmodified legacy repository is preserved
under `_legacy_analysis/` for reference. GSi, Genuine Soundware, D&R and the
Cinemix are not affiliated with this project.

